  "design": {
    "entrance": "Hundreds of disorganised points and short data lines drift in depth, then converge in a left-to-right wave onto a lattice inside the letterforms, forming a wireframe of the title.",
    "reveal": "At the impact frame the point-lattice resolves block-by-block into the solid wordmark with an edge pulse.",
    "camera": "Slow drift-in with depth parallax on the background node lattice.",
    "material": "Clean white emissive face with a mint inner edge; mint data points and lines on a deep navy void.",
    "exit": "Decompile: the wordmark de-resolves block-by-block back into points that float upward and dissipate."
  },
  "fusion_notes": [
    "The Fusion version converges a pEmitter point field (Transform scale/centre onto the title) and resolves the wordmark with a FastNoise threshold; the preview converges points sampled from the actual glyph shapes and resolves in square blocks."
  ],
